val__A_Unified_Evaluation_Framework_for_Streaming_Video_Understanding\",\"offset\":2107},{\"match\":\"StreamingEval\",\"offset\":2188},{\"match\":\"StreamingEval\",\"offset\":2397},{\"match\":\"StreamingScore\",\"offset\":2526},{\"match\":\"StreamingScore\",\"offset\":2586}],\"excerpt\":\"## Online Video-LLM (Streaming Video Understanding)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nOnline Video-LLM（在线视频大语言模型）是一类特殊的 Video Large Language Model，区别于传统的 Offline Video-LLM（输入完整视频后一次性生成答案），Online Video-LLM 需要：**始终在线（always-on）**、**逐帧接收视频流输入**、**具备时间决策能力（temporal decision-making）**——即在上下文合适的时刻主动生成响应，而非被动每帧输出或仅在…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Asymmetric Token Retention in Streaming VLMs（流式视觉语言模型中的非对称Token保留策略）.md\",\"basename\":\"Asymmetric Token Retention in Streaming VLMs（流式视觉语言模型中的非对称Token保留策略）\",\"score\":151.92114617702336,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-level\",\"streaming_inference_step\",\"streamingvlm__real-time_understanding_for_infinite_video_streams\",\"streamingvlm\",\"streaming\",\"streams\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":33},{\"match\":\"StreamingVLM\",\"offset\":159},{\"match\":\"streaming_inference_step\",\"offset\":759},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":2137},{\"match\":\"Dual-Level\",\"offset\":2157},{\"match\":\"StreamingVLM\",\"offset\":2210},{\"match\":\"StreamingVLM__Real-Time_Understanding_for_Infinite_Video_Streams\",\"offset\":2323}],\"excerpt\":\"## Asymmetric Token Retention in Streaming VLMs（流式视觉语言模型中的非对称Token保留策略）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nAsymmetric Token Retention（非对称 Token 保留）是 StreamingVLM 提出的流式推理 KV Cache 管理策略，用于在无限视频流中以稳定、有界的延迟实时生成响应。核心思想：三种 token 类型遵循不同的驱逐优先级——(1) Attention Sink Tokens（Tsink=512）：system prompt + 早期 text tokens，最高保留优先级，从不驱逐，作为 at…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Streaming Memory with Scene Detection（基于场景检测的流式记忆）.md\",\"basename\":\"Streaming Memory with Scene Detection（基于场景检测的流式记忆）\",\"score\":143.4309498606782,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-grained\",\"stream\",\"streamingmemory\",\"streaming\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":99},{\"match\":\"Dual-grained\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":570},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":675},{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":855},{\"match\":\"StreamingMemory\",\"offset\":2178},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":3235},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":3697}],\"excerpt\":\"## Streaming Memory with Scene Detection（基于场景检测的流式记忆）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nStreaming Memory 是 PEARL Dual-grained Memory System 中负责存储和检索**流式视频历史观察**的模块。其核心功能：(1) **增量归档**——当视频流连续到达时，对每个检测到的场景边界处的新 clip 计算多模态嵌入，以 (clip, embedding) 对的形式追加存储；(2) **语义检索**——基于余弦相似度检索与查询语义最相关的历史 clips。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/DuoAttention.md\",\"basename\":\"DuoAttention\",\"score\":54.73864634266075,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"stream\",\"streamingllm,\",\"streamingllm\",\"streaming_attn。在合成\",\"streaming\",\"stream_out\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":140},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":268},{\"match\":\"streaming\",\"offset\":516},{\"match\":\")·streaming_attn。在\",\"offset\":564},{\"match\":\", streami\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"），streami\",\"offset\":1052},{\"match\":\"中 streami\",\"offset\":1142},{\"match\":\"stream_o\",\"offset\":1726},{\"match\":\"M_streami\",\"offset\":1759},{\"match\":\") · stream\",\"offset\":1839},{\"match\":\"lse \\\"stre\",\"offset\":2318},{\"match\":\"R-1, stre\",\"offset\":2404},{\"match\":\"e 3:\",\"offset\":2449},{\"match\":\"ent (stre\",\"offset\":2682},{\"match\":\"ing (stre\",\"offset\":2881},{\"match\":\"# stre\",\"offset\":2979},{\"match\":\"k)\\n# Stre\",\"offset\":3131},{\"match\":\"OVA, Streamin\",\"offset\":4173},{\"match\":\"and Stre\",\"offset\":4553}],\"excerpt\":\"DuoAttention（Xiao et al., 2025, MIT & NVIDIA）是一个将 LLM 的 attention head 分类为 Retrieval Heads 和 Streaming Heads 的 KV cache 压缩框架。核心观察：仅少数 attention head（Retrieval Heads）对长上下文处理至关重要，需要 full attention across all tokens；多数 head（Streaming Heads）主要关注 attention sink（首 token）和最近 token，可以使用 constant-length KV cache（仅保留 sink + recent tokens）。\\nDuoAttention 包含三个阶段：\\n1. **Retrieval Head Identification（训练）*…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）.md\",\"basename\":\"SGLang（结构化语言模型程序执行框架）\",\"score\":42.95214577369522,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-dimensional\",\"streaming\",\"stream异步并发执行cross\",\"stream异步并发执行cross-precision\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"stream异步并发执行cross-precision\",\"offset\":1448},{\"match\":\"Dual-dimensional\",\"offset\":1624},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":1725}],\"excerpt\":\"…tized Linear layer替换SGLang原生FP16 Linear，使用CUDA Graph捕获完整quantization→GEMM→dequantization工作流，通过多CUDA stream异步并发执行cross-precision kernel。开源地址：https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang。\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- Towards High-Goodput LLM Serving with Prefill-decode Multiplexing\\n- RoMeo: Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\\n- TokenFlow: Responsive LLM Text Streaming Serving under…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Pipeline Stage Boundary Communication-Computation Overlap for mHC.md\",\"basename\":\"Pipeline Stage Boundary Communication-Computation Overlap for mHC\",\"score\":42.32958098792597,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dualpipe\",\"stream\",\"stream:\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":116},{\"match\":\"DualPipe\",\"offset\":165},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":270},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":697},{\"match\":\"DualPipe\",\"offset\":815},{\"match\":\"stream:\",\"offset\":934},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1066},{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":1086},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1120},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1144}],\"excerpt\":\"在 mHC 的流水线并行中，pipeline stage 边界需要传输 n-stream 残差状态（nC 元素，n 倍于标准残差连接）。为消除这一额外通信延迟，mHC 扩展 DualPipe schedule 实现了细粒度的通信-计算重叠机制。\\n两个关键技术：(1) MLP 层（FFN）的 $\\\\mathcal{F}_{post,res}$ kernel 在专用高优先级 CUDA stream 上执行，能在通信到达时被抢占，避免了传统 persistent kernel 长时间阻塞 SM 的问题；(2) Attention 层避免使用 persistent kernel，防止长时间运行操作阻塞调度器。重计算过程与 pipeline 通信解耦，因为每 stage 的首层…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Split-Phase Transmission（分阶段传输）.md\",\"basename\":\"Split-Phase Transmission（分阶段传输）\",\"score\":40.917655348831154,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-track\",\"stream\",\"stream:\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"dual-track\",\"offset\":81},{\"match\":\"Stream:\",\"offset\":428},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1015},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1086},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1136},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1149},{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":1184},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1212}],\"excerpt\":\"Split-Phase Transmission 是 PROBE 中用于在 dual-track 架构下管理 P2P expert weight prefetch 带宽的技术。核心思想是将 expert 传输拆分为两个阶段：(1) Phase 1 — 在当前层 L 的 MoE Compute 期间启动 P2P 传输，利用计算 kernel 不消耗网络带宽的特性；(2) 在 All-to-All Combine 之前暂停传输，释放 NVLink/NVSwitch 带宽给关键通信路径；(3) Phase 2 — Combine 完成后恢复传输，利用下一层 L+1 的 Attention 计算窗口完成剩余传输。\\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语：\\n```\\nTimeline…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Hierarchical Visual Memory Management (HVMM).md\",\"basename\":\"Hierarchical Visual Memory Management (HVMM)\",\"score\":35.42960217269017,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"stream\",\"streamingbench\",\"streaming\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":145},{\"match\":\"mic\",\"offset\":451},{\"match\":\"Curve\",\"offset\":1648},{\"match\":\"ory）在 Streamin\",\"offset\":1767},{\"match\":\"Curve\",\"offset\":2102},{\"match\":\"sting_Str\",\"offset\":2119}],\"excerpt\":\"Hierarchical Visual Memory Management (HVMM) 是 CurveStream 的记忆调度模块，负责在固定 token 预算（N_max = 20 frames）下对 CAS 输出的曲率分数序列进行动态路由决策。HVMM 的核心机制包含两个子组件：(1) Online Manifold Distribution Estimation —— 使用 Exponential Moving Average (EMA) 在线更新曲率分数的瞬态分布参数：μ_t = γ·μ_{t-1} + (1-γ)·CS_t, σ_t² = γ·σ_{t-1}² + (1-γ)·(CS_t - μ_t)²，其中 γ ∈ (0,1) 为动量因子，控制历史观测窗口大小；(2) K-Sigm…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Response-Silence Decoding Framework.md\",\"basename\":\"Response-Silence Decoding Framework\",\"score\":33.724207715230136,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-level\",\"stream\",\"streaming\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":759},{\"match\":\"Dual-Leve\",\"offset\":2231},{\"match\":\"Streamin\",\"offset\":2809},{\"match\":\"_Streamin\",\"offset\":2972}],\"excerpt\":\"│     Video Frame Stream            │\\n            │  Frm^1 → Frm^2 → ... → Frm^T     │\\n            └──────────────┬───────────────────┘\\n                           │ 逐帧进入\\n                           ▼\\n            ┌──────────────────────────────────┐\\n            │   Vision Encoder (InternViT)      │\\n            │   Fram…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Bit-Width-Aware I_O-Compute Pipeline (位宽感知 I_O-计算流水线).md\",\"basename\":\"Bit-Width-Aware I_O-Compute Pipeline (位宽感知 I_O-计算流水线)\",\"score\":31.698941873607303,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"stream\",\"stream:\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"dual\",\"offset\":535},{\"match\":\"dual\",\"offset\":562},{\"match\":\"dual\",\"offset\":1245},{\"match\":\"Stream:\",\"offset\":1628},{\"match\":\"Stream:\",\"offset\":1696},{\"match\":\"dual\",\"offset\":1849},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2093},{\"match\":\"Dual\",\"offset\":2567}],\"excerpt\":\"…INT2、2 个选 INT3），传统方式需加载 1 份独立 INT2 + 2 份独立 INT3；MWQ 方式仅加载 1 份 shared INT2 base + 2 份 1-bit INT3 residual，且 INT2 base 加载时其它 residual I/O 可与 computation 重叠。\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在系统架构中发挥作用，给出术语在系统架构中运转流程的具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n以 Environment 1 (RTX 3060, 6GB), LLaMA-MoE-3.5B, M=1600MB, 32 requests 为例：\\n```\\n=== Bit-Width-Aware Pipeline 执行流程 ===\\nPhase 1: 离线 Profiling（安装时执行一次）\\n    for each bitwidth b_k in…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Selective Recomputing _ Gradient Checkpointing for mHC.md\",\"basename\":\"Selective Recomputing _ Gradient Checkpointing for mHC\",\"score\":31.27108233288689,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dualpipe\",\"stream\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":158},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":202},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":352},{\"match\":\"DualPipe\",\"offset\":1535}],\"excerpt\":\"Selective Recomputing（选择性重计算）是在训练反向传播中，丢弃前向 pass 的中间激活并在反向 pass 中重新计算它们的策略，以显存换计算。mHC 由于 n-stream 设计导致中间激活量约为标准残差连接的 n 倍（每层额外存储 nC 元素的 stream + C 元素的层输入），选择性重计算将这些中间激活丢弃并在反向需要时重新执行 mHC kernel（不含沉重的层函数 $\\\\mathcal{F}$）。\\nmHC 的重计算策略优化：对于 $L_r$ 连续层，仅需持久化首层输入 $\\\\mathbf{x}_{l_0}$（nC 元素），中间层的 stream 和映射系数在反向中重计算。最优块大小：$L_r^* \\\\approx \\\\sqrt{nL/(n+2)}$，在实践中与 pipeline stage 中的层数对齐。总持久化存储：$\\\\lceil L/L_r…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Continuous Lookahead Pipelining（连续前瞻流水线）.md\",\"basename\":\"Continuous Lookahead Pipelining（连续前瞻流水线）\",\"score\":30.26356706282717,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-track\",\"stream\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"dual-track\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":427}],\"excerpt\":\"双轨（dual-track）执行模型是 Continuous Lookahead Pipelining 的架构基础：\\n```\\nMain Stream (Deterministic Track)          Auxiliary Track (Control Plane)\\n├─ Layer L-1 Attention (Compute)           │\\n├─ Layer L-1 All-to-All Dispatch (Net)     ├─ Predict for Layer L (MLP+AllGather)\\n│…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Cross-precision GEMM（跨精度矩阵乘法）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-precision GEMM（跨精度矩阵乘法）\",\"score\":29.249650422423443,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-dimensional\",\"stream上并发执行→掩盖单独kernel的launch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"stream上并发执行→掩盖单独kernel的launch\",\"offset\":2469},{\"match\":\"Dual-dimensional\",\"offset\":2636}],\"excerpt\":\"- 异步并发执行：四种kernel在不同CUDA stream上并发执行→掩盖单独kernel的launch overhead和tall-and-skinny矩阵的SM underutilization\\n- 结果合并：低精度W4A4结果为基础，高精度outlier计算结果通过post-mul overwrite覆盖对应位置\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- RoMeo: Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Manifold-Constrained Hyper-Connections (mHC).md\",\"basename\":\"Manifold-Constrained Hyper-Connections (mHC)\",\"score\":28.598554576278303,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dualpipe\",\"stream\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\"