 Detection（基于场景检测的流式记忆）.md\",\"basename\":\"Streaming Memory with Scene Detection（基于场景检测的流式记忆）\",\"score\":143.4309498606782,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-grained\",\"stream\",\"streamingmemory\",\"streaming\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":99},{\"match\":\"Dual-grained\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":570},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":675},{\"match\":\"Stream\",\"offset\":855},{\"match\":\"StreamingMemory\",\"offset\":2178},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":3235},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":3697}],\"excerpt\":\"## Streaming Memory with Scene Detection（基于场景检测的流式记忆）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nStreaming Memory 是 PEARL Dual-grained Memory System 中负责存储和检索**流式视频历史观察**的模块。其核心功能：(1) **增量归档**——当视频流连续到达时，对每个检测到的场景边界处的新 clip 计算多模态嵌入，以 (clip, embedding) 对的形式追加存储；(2) **语义检索**——基于余弦相似度检索与查询语义最相关的历史 clips。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/DuoAttention.md\",\"basename\":\"DuoAttention\",\"score\":54.73864634266075,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"stream\",\"streamingllm,\",\"streamingllm\",\"streaming_attn。在合成\",\"streaming\",\"stream_out\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":140},{\"match\":\"Streaming\",\"offset\":268},{\"match\":\"streaming\",\"offset\":516},{\"match\":\")·streaming_attn。在\",\"offset\":564},{\"match\":\", streami\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"），streami\",\"offset\":1052},{\"match\":\"中 streami\",\"offset\":1142},{\"match\":\"stream_o\",\"offset\":1726},{\"match\":\"M_streami\",\"offset\":1759},{\"match\":\") · stream\",\"offset\":1839},{\"match\":\"lse \\\"stre\",\"offset\":2318},{\"match\":\"R-1, stre\",\"offset\":2404},{\"match\":\"e 3:\",\"offset\":2449},{\"match\":\"ent (stre\",\"offset\":2682},{\"match\":\"ing (stre\",\"offset\":2881},{\"match\":\"# stre\",\"offset\":2979},{\"match\":\"k)\\n# Stre\",\"offset\":3131},{\"match\":\"OVA, Streamin\",\"offset\":4173},{\"match\":\"and Stre\",\"offset\":4553}],\"excerpt\":\"DuoA