che**（对话内缓存）—— 在一个对话轮次内（即一个语义片段…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/DualPipe Pipeline Schedule.md","basename":"DualPipe Pipeline Schedule","score":496.6877828642939,"foundWords":["dual","dualpipe","stream","stream，能在通信到达时被抢占，确保通信不阻塞。attention","stream）。在"],"matches":[{"match":"DualPipe","offset":3},{"match":"DualPipe","offset":39},{"match":"DualPipe","offset":258},{"match":"DualPipe","offset":295},{"match":"DualPipe","offset":396},{"match":"stream","offset":414},{"match":"DualPipe","offset":485},{"match":"stream","offset":783},{"match":"DualPipe","offset":1176},{"match":"stream","offset":1225},{"match":"stream","offset":1238},{"match":"stream）。在","offset":1260},{"match":"stream","offset":1283},{"match":"stream，能在通信到达时被抢占，确保通信不阻塞。Attention","offset":1353}],"excerpt":"## DualPipe Pipeline Schedule\n术语是什么？\nDualPipe 是 DeepSeek-V3 (Liu et al., 2024b) 提出的双向流水线并行调度算法，用于大规模模型训练中重叠计算和通信。核心特点是从 pipeline 两端同时注入 micro-batch（forward 和 backward），使前向和后向计算在时间上交错，最大化计算和通信的重叠率。\n标准 1F1B（One-Forward-One-Backward）流水线并行存在 bubble（空闲等待时间），而 DualPipe 通过双向调度将 bubble 填充为反向计算或通信操作。DualPipe…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Dual-grained Memory System（双粒度记忆系统）.md","basename":"Dual-grained Memory System（双粒度记忆系统）","score":444.2934422577114,"foundWords":["dual","dual-grained","streaming"],"matches":[{"match":"Dual-grained","offset":3},{"match":"Dual-grained","offset":84},{"match":"Streaming","offset":252},{"match":"Dual-grained","offset":557},{"match":"Dual-grained","offset":679},{"match":"Streaming","offset":809},{"match":"Streaming","offset":1860},{"match":"Streaming","offset":2002},{"match":"Streaming","offset":2143},{"match":"Streaming","offset":2464},{"match":"Streaming","offset":2770},{"match":"Streaming","offset":2933}],"excerpt":"## Dual-grained Memory System（双粒度记忆系统）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nDual-grained Memory System 是 PEARL 框架的核心系统架构组件，将个性化流式视频理解中的记忆显式解耦为两个独立模块：(1) **Concept Memory（概念记忆）**——存储用户自定义概念的\"概念中心知识\"（概念名 + 视觉证据 + VLM 生成的紧凑描述），以概念名作为键进行精确检索；(2) **