{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_06_NRLMoQbIj9ecEcDunsXj2759","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/RoMeo_ Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization.md\",\"basename\":\"RoMeo_ Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\",\"score\":386.04993309525685,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-dimensional\",\"stream上异步并发执行。使用cuda\",\"stream上异步并发执行\",\"streams→dequantization\",\"streams管理quantization和gemm\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Dual-dimensional\",\"offset\":21},{\"match\":\"stream上异步并发执行。使用CUDA\",\"offset\":378},{\"match\":\"streams管理quantization和GEMM\",\"offset\":1443},{\"match\":\"streams→dequantization\",\"offset\":2153}],\"excerpt\":\"## RoMeo: Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  提出RoMeo LLM serving系统，集成RTMPQ算法到SGLang serving框架。核心系统级实现：(1) 异步并发执行（Asynchronous Concurrent Execution）：将activation量化分解为outlier token量化和normal token量化两个独立任务，四个cross-precision乘法kernel（W4A4/W4A8/W8A4/W8A8…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/RoMeo_ Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization.md\",\"basename\":\"RoMeo_ Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\",\"score\":354.27022111803694,\"foundWords\":[\"dual\",\"dual-dimensional\",\"streams各自launch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Dual-dimensional\",\"offset\":21},{\"match\":\"streams各自launch\",\"offset\":3596}],\"excerpt\":\"## RoMeo: Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\\n- 属于kernel调度/运行时计算的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  提出RoMeo的cross-precision混合精度GEMM kernel系统和辅助kernel。核心kernel/runtime设计：(1) Permutation-free Mixed Precision Computation：预分配dedicated outlier buffer（大小基于预定的outlier token数量），整个activation矩阵量化为INT4，outl…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/D2MoE_ Dual R