liers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization","score":354.27022111803694,"foundWords":["dual","dual-dimensional","streams各自launch"],"matches":[{"match":"Dual-dimensional","offset":21},{"match":"streams各自launch","offset":3596}],"excerpt":"## RoMeo: Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization\n- 属于kernel调度/运行时计算的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\n  提出RoMeo的cross-precision混合精度GEMM kernel系统和辅助kernel。核心kernel/runtime设计：(1) Permutation-free Mixed Precision Computation：预分配dedicated outlier buffer（大小基于预定的outlier token数量），整个activation矩阵量化为INT4，outl…"},{"filename":"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving.md","basename":"D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving","score":270.688870828845,"foundWords":["dual","stream","stream:"],"matches":[{"match":"Dual","offset":10},{"match":"Dual","offset":3086},{"match":"Stream","offset":4930},{"match":"Stream:","offset":5059},{"match":"dual","offset":5828}],"excerpt":"## D2MoE: Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\n  实现是 D2MoE 的在线执行引擎，包含三个核心 Serving 调度组件：(1) **Bit-Width-Aware I/O-Compute Pipeline**：将传统\"按 expert ID 顺序执行 I/O+Compute\"改为按 fine-grained bit-width 级重新排序（Figure 9d），利用 MWQ 嵌套结构使低 bit-width 权重可…"},{"filename":"experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving.md","basename":"D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving","score":265.8556647241312,"foundWords":["dual","stream"],"matches":[{"match":"Dual","offset":10},{"match":"stream","offset":320},{"match":"dual","offset":560},{"match":"dual","offset":1299},{"match":"stream","offset":1331},{"match":"dual","offset":1873},{"match":"Stream","offset":1980},{"match":"stream","offset":2047},{"match":"stream","offset":2107},{"match":"dual","offset":2383},{"match":"dual","