-all\",\"to\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"All-to-All（二维层次化全交换）\",\"offset\":38},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":109},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":162},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"All-to-All（m\",\"offset\":423},{\"match\":\"All-to-All（n/m\",\"offset\":507},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":554},{\"match\":\"All-to-All:\",\"offset\":610},{\"match\":\"ALL2ALL_2DH\",\"offset\":650},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1063},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1579},{\"match\":\"`alltoa\",\"offset\":2518},{\"match\":\"r All-to-A\",\"offset\":2687}],\"excerpt\":\"## 2DH (Two-Dimensional Hierarchical) All-to-All（二维层次化全交换）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n2DH All-to-All 是 TUTEL 提出的新型 All-to-All 通信算法，解决标准 Linear All-to-All 在大规模 GPU 集群中因消息大小 S/n 过小而无法饱和网络带宽的问题。核心思想：将 All-to-All 分解为节点内（intra-node）和节点间（inter-node）两个层次，通过 stride memory copy 将非连续的小 chunks 聚合为大 chunks，在大规模下保持高链路利用率。2DH 算法包含…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/DeepSpeed-Ulysses (All-to-All Sequence Parallelism).md\",\"basename\":\"DeepSpeed-Ulysses (All-to-All Sequence Parallelism)\",\"score\":1194.9396596258475,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"all完成并行\",\"all通信\",\"all恢复sequence\",\"all绕过此overhead\",\"all沿inner\",\"all阶段\",\"all_to_all\",\"all-to-all。达成1.01x-1.39x\",\"all-to-all绕过此overhead，kernel代码\",\"all-to-all绕过此overhead\",\"all-to-all沿inner\",\"all-to-all完成并行，通信开销集中在all-to-all阶段。\",\"all-to-all完成并行\",\"all-to-all\",\"to\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":22},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":45},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":99},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":165},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":234},{\"match\":\"all-to-all完成并行，通信开销集中在all-to-all阶段。\",\"offset\":304},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":445},{\"match\":\"all_to_all\",\"offset\":466},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":664},{\"match\":\"all_to_all\",\"offset\":684},{\"match\":\"all-to-all沿inner\",\"offset\":756},{\"match\"