oall（仅\",\"offset\":1045},{\"match\":\"tokens）+\",\"offset\":1062},{\"match\":\"alltoall（local\",\"offset\":1089},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":1259},{\"match\":\"torch\",\"offset\":1268},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":1286},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":1290},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":1293}],\"excerpt\":\"## Uneven AlltoAll in MoE Training (MoE训练中的不等长全交换)\\n术语是什么？\\nUneven AlltoAll（也称 alltoallv）是 MPI 风格的集合通信原语，允许每个参与方发送和接收不等量的数据。在 X-MoE 的 padding-free MoE pipeline 中，由于消除了 zero-padding，每个 expert 接收的 token 数量不同（由 tokens_per_expert ERI-array 描述），因此必须使用 uneven alltoall 替代传统 MoE 框架中的 even alltoall。\\n从kernel调度角度拆解：\\n传…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in Distributed MoE Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"All-to-All Communication in Distributed MoE Inference\",\"score\":1105.0104063004967,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"allv\",\"alltoall/alltoallv\",\"alltoall_combine\",\"alltoall_dispatch\",\"alltoallv,\",\"alltoallv\",\"alltoall\",\"allto\",\"all-to-all：\",\"all-to-all\",\"to\",\"torch\",\"topology）\",\"topology\",\"tokens\",\"token\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":147},{\"match\":\"All-to-All：\",\"offset\":183},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":314},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":392},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":445},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":599},{\"match\":\"alltoallv,\",\"offset\":616},{\"match\":\"alltoall_dispatch\",\"offset\":645},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":669},{\"match\":\"alltoall_combine\",\"offset\":764},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":946},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1110},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1212},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll/AlltoAllv\",\"offset\":1285},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":1308},{\"match\":\"topology）\",\"offset\":1342}],\"excerpt\":\"## All-to-All Communication in Distributed MoE Inference\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nAll-to-All Communication 是分布式 MoE expert parallelism (EP) 的核心集合通信操作。每 MoE 层需要两轮 All-to-All：(1) Dispatch——将各 GPU 的 tokens 按 gate 选择的 expert index 发送到 hosting GPU；(2) Combine——将 expert 计算完成的输出 tokens 返回…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Adaptive All-to-All Communication（自适应全交换通信）.md\",\"basename\":\"Adaptive All-to-All Communication（自适应全交换通信）\",\"score\":1090.8703340187267,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"alltoallv:\",\"alltoallv\",\"all_gather\",\"all-gather\",\"all-to-all。与\",\"all-to-all\",\"to\",\"torch\",\"tokens\",\"token\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":12},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":163},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":174},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":309},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":346},{\"match\":\"all-gather\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":424},{\"match\":\"alltoallv\",\"offset\":478},{\"match\":\"all-gather\",\"offset\":514},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":595},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":667},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":693},{\"match\":\"All-gather\",\"offset\":919},{\"match\":\"all_gather\",\"offset\":982},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1085},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1114},{\"match\":\"alltoallv:\",\"offset\":1153},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":1245},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":1252},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1363},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1500},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1512},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1555},{\"match\":\"Torch\",\"offset\":1591},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":1661},{\"match\":\"all-gather\",\"offset\":1678},{\"match\":\"torch\",\"offset\":1711},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":1729},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":1733},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":1736},{\"match\":\"all-to-all。与\",\"offset\":1750},{\"match\":\"alltoallv\",\"offset\":1777},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":1860},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":1881}],\"excerpt\":\"## Adapti