Reduce\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"All-Reduce\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"All-Reduce\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"内 all-reduce（NVLink）带宽远高于节点间（InfiniBand），\",\"offset\":278},{\"match\":\"的 all-redu\",\"offset\":325},{\"match\":\"的 all-to-al\",\"offset\":347},{\"match\":\"g All-Redu\",\"offset\":389},{\"match\":\"+ All-Gath\",\"offset\":432},{\"match\":\"]\",\"offset\":562},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":650},{\"match\":\"la\",\"offset\":667},{\"match\":\": All-Gath\",\"offset\":683},{\"match\":\"k\",\"offset\":745},{\"match\":\"的 all-redu\",\"offset\":814},{\"match\":\"的 all-to-all\",\"offset\":903},{\"match\":\"E all-redu\",\"offset\":950},{\"match\":\"N all-redu\",\"offset\":972},{\"match\":\"f tot\",\"offset\":993},{\"match\":\"clA\",\"offset\":1085},{\"match\":\"PyTor\",\"offset\":1130},{\"match\":\"`tor\",\"offset\":1140},{\"match\":\"d.a\",\"offset\":1158},{\"match\":\"的 all-redu\",\"offset\":1188},{\"match\":\"ara\",\"offset\":1236},{\"match\":\"ara\",\"offset\":1325}],\"excerpt\":\"## All-Reduce Communication in Distributed Training（分布式训练中的全归约通信）\\n术语是什么？\\nAll-Reduce 是分布式训练中最核心的集合通信原语之一。将各设备上的数据（通常是梯度或 hidden states）求和/平均后广播到所有设备。在 TP 中用于同步 FFN/attention 的输出和梯度；在 DP 中用于同步梯度。All-Reduce 的通信复杂度为 O(2(N-1)/N · data_size)，在 ring 算法下每设备收/发 2(N-1)·data_size/N 数据。节点内 all-reduce（NVLink）带宽远高于…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/MoE Task Abstraction (AbsCompressor _ AbsAlltoAll _ AbsExpert).md\",\"basename\":\"MoE Task Abstraction (AbsCompressor _ AbsAlltoAll _ AbsExpert)\",\"score\":672.693606455332,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"alltoall=pipealltoall,\",\"alltoall\",\"allto\",\"all_to_all\",\"to\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":44},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":227},{\"match\":\"all_to_all\",\"offset\":241},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":741},{\"match\":\"all_to_all\",\"offset\":797},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":1073},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":1093},{\"match\":\"all_to_all\",\"offset\":1113},{\"match\":\"alltoall=PipeAlltoAll,\",\"offset\":1355},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":1511}],\"excerpt\":\"## MoE Task Abstraction (AbsCompressor / AbsAlltoAll / AbsExpert)\\n术语是什么？\\nMoE Task Abstraction 是 ScheMoE 提出的一套模块化任务抽象接口，将 MoE layer 训练中的三类关键操作封装为独立的可替换模块：**AbsCompressor**（提供 compress/decompress 接口，支持 ZFP/FP16/INT8 等压缩算法）、**AbsAlltoAll**（提供 all_to_all 接口，支持 NCCL-A2A/1DH-A2A/2DH-A2A/Pipe-A2A 等通信算法）、**AbsExpert**（封装 expert fflayer 计算，主要用于 Profi…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Token-to-Expert Prediction (Token级专家预测).md\",\"basename\":\"Token-to-Expert Prediction (Token级专家预测)\",\"score\":586.4647174386074,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"all-to-all\",\"to\",\"token级专家预测\",\"token_embeddings\",\"token-to-expert\",\"tokens,\",\"tokens\",\"token\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Token-to-Expert\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Token级专家预测\",\"offset\":31},{\"match\":\"Token-to-Expert\",\"offset\":51},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":105},{\"match\":\"token-to-expert\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":167},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":238},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":312},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":394},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":615},{\"match\":\"token_embeddings\",\"offset\":635},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":746},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":903},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":979},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1100},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":1122},{\"match\":\"tokens,\",\"offset\":1143},{\"match\":\"tokens,\",\"offset\":1198},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":1303},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":1567},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":1618},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":1736}],\"excerpt\":\"## Token-to-Expert Prediction (Token级专家预测)\\n术语是什么？\\nToken-to-Expert Prediction 是传统 MoE expert 预测策略：直接预测每个 token 将被路由到哪个 expert，即 exact token-to-expert mapping。预测结果用于跳过 All-to-All 的 Scatter 阶段（Direct Routing），同时均衡 FFN compute 和通信。代价是 predictor 本身的 inference overhead。MoE-GPS 将 expert selection 建模为多分类问题，探索…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/SparseAllGather.md\",\"base